WEBVTT

00:00:03.215 --> 00:00:05.283
Next, create the list itself.

00:00:05.283 --> 00:00:10.187
Under Content, Content Items, the New menu offers Help Center, like any other

00:00:10.187 --> 00:00:12.195
content type you can create.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.696
Enter the title Help Center.

00:00:14.696 --> 00:00:16.970
The permalink is generated for you.

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:18.135
Choose Publish:

00:00:18.135 --> 00:00:21.520
the list is published, and you return to Content Items.

00:00:21.985 --> 00:00:26.149
The Help Center row has a button for its items, List Page Items.

00:00:26.149 --> 00:00:29.065
It opens the page of the list in the admin.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:32.502
The page of the list says that it is empty.

00:00:32.502 --> 00:00:37.820
Create Page adds the first item, and the editor opens with links back to the list.

00:00:38.283 --> 00:00:41.835
Enter the title Reset your password and choose Publish.

00:00:41.835 --> 00:00:44.863
You return to the list, and the item is in it.

00:00:45.315 --> 00:00:48.125
Save Draft keeps an item unpublished.

00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:52.635
Create a second item, Export your data, and save it as a draft.

00:00:52.635 --> 00:00:54.335
The list shows both.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:59.433
Create a third item, Change your email address, and choose Publish.

00:00:59.433 --> 00:01:02.860
The list shows all three, the most recent first.

